# Commander's Sphere (CR 903.4f, 701.21a): with two commanders its first ability adds one mana of a color in
# their combined identity. The second ability's cost is only the sacrifice, so it can be activated after the
# artifact has already tapped for mana and the red mana remains in the pool while the card is drawn.

